...@../../../dev/d2/themes/sequence
# W10: continuation of the same synchronous callback in W02, not a fresh attempt.
shape: sequence_diagram
coord: Rust coordination service
scheme: Serialized Scheme owner
ledger: Durable ledger
broker: Final broker
upstream: Upstream
coord -> coord: Continue original callback / verified positive consumption
coord -> ledger: S4 Current-state CAS / audit / holds
ledger -> coord: SendCommitted / own transition V to V+1
broker -> coord: S5 Claim exact attempt
coord -> ledger: CAS with current derived premise / fence
ledger -> coord: One durable claim
coord -> broker: One local emission handle
broker -> broker: Final bytes / target / credential / deadline gate
broker -> upstream: One application request start\nNo hidden retry / redirect / mirror
broker -> coord: Attributable emitter closure\nNo future application submissions
upstream -> broker: Selected attributable business result / usage
broker -> coord: S6 Bound outcome and usage evidence
coord -> ledger: Deduplicate observation records
coord -> ledger: Atomic budget settlement from admitted evidence
coord -> scheme: Callback result under capability ack contract
scheme -> coord: Non-durable lifecycle receipt\nNever a new dispatch right
coord.caveat: "no repeated issue or consume between W02 and W10.\nThis selected result order is not universal; W07 separates emitter, outcome and settlement."
coord.class: runtime
scheme.class: semantic
ledger.class: ledger
broker.class: runtime
upstream.class: ledger
coord.caveat.class: note

